# The build context of deploy/probe.Dockerfile: an allowlist. Everything in the
# checkout is left out, and only what that Dockerfile COPYs is let back in: the
# root manifests, each workspace's manifest (npm ci needs them), and the sources
# of the contract and the prober. No source of the scanner or of local results.
# packages/scanner/tests/image.test.ts holds this list to the COPY lines.
*
!LICENSE
!NOTICE
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!tsconfig.base.json
!packages/contract/package.json
!packages/contract/tsconfig.json
!packages/contract/src
!packages/scanner/package.json
!packages/report/package.json
!packages/probe/package.json
!packages/probe/tsconfig.json
!packages/probe/src
